<title>UK: Hamburgische LB sets 10 bln peseta four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Hamburgische LB sets 10 bln peseta four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Argentaria, Banco Bilbao Vizcaya, Banque Nationale de Paris, and Urquigo.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HAMBURGISCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT     10 BLN ESP   COUPON     5.44	MATURITY   *10.SEP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.90    PAY DATE    10.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	DENOMS (K) 100	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR ON 10.SEP.98</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
